OL,3,AIs a whale fossil the leftovers of a
OL,4,ABronze Age Sunday roast?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe find has been described as a
OL,7,Ftotally unique, with geologists and
OL,8,Fmarine specialists trying to establish
OL,9,Fthe fossil's story and the Natural
OL,10,FHistory Museum in London helping to
OL,11,Fidentify it.
OL,13,FIt was found on the same beach where
OL,14,FIreland's only dinosaur bones were
OL,15,Fdiscovered in the late 19th Century and
OL,16,Fthe 1980s.
